1133: 		    Now a LATCHED DECLINE that falls out of the switch and
1134: 		    returns.  The diagnostic is kept in full -- it names the op
1135: 		    and the vertices, which is what a maintainer implementing
1136: 		    the primitive would want -- and gains `-- declined.  (once)'
1137: 		    so it cannot be mistaken for the old host kill and cannot
1138: 		    flood a guest loop.  */
