   SW/LW are 32-bit; SB is 8-bit; LD is 64-bit. `store(op=...)` and `run_ops` accommodate the additional instructions. Before the colour declines, bits 0�?"11 are set and bit 12 is clear. Require all twelve prerequisite announcements, exactly one `ANN`, and the retained paint. Sharing **any** existing bit suppresses the colour announcement and reds that row.

